Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.85,0:00:59.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石之派大星爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.85,0:00:59.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir Patrick of the Rock
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.77,0:01:03.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汝乃流浪之虾鼻子上的破疣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:03.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thou art a frayed wart on the nose of a vagrant shrimp
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No offense
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,None taken
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.38,0:01:09.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方裤屋之海绵爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:09.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir Square of the House of Pants
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:12.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汝乃为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:12.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thou'st art, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.77,0:01:15.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,深海之乱七八糟玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:15.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a dipsey ding-dang-doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.85,0:01:17.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无意失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:17.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No disrespect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,None taken
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都够了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们吵架  我又要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to be doing while you two fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是落难的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the damsel in distress
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扯淡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nuts to that
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.11,0:01:34.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是少女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:34.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I ain't no damsel
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且也没落难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I ain't in no distress
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.35,0:01:43.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是把黏土当大脑的发霉屁股溃疡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:43.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You moldy, clay-brained rump cankers
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.15,0:01:52.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她的话就像匕首  直刺我的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:52.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Her words be like daggers unto mine ears
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.59,0:01:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假如我有耳朵就真刺中了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or they would be if I had ears
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.90,0:01:59.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真希望我们能多来点朋友一起混
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:59.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sure wish we had more friends to hang out with
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.19,0:02:02.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像是咱该混个圈子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:02.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like we should join a clique?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.69,0:02:03.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:03.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.00,0:02:04.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:04.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道圈子是什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what a clique is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.56,0:02:07.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:07.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:09.60,注释,,0,0,0,,[ click（咔哒声）与 clique（圈子）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.65,0:02:14.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,圈子就是兴趣相似的一群朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A clique is a group of friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that share similar interests
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来找圈子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's find a clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.25,0:02:23.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一旦开始找圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:23.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When you start looking for a clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.29,0:02:25.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就处处都能看到圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:25.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you see them everywhere
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肌肉圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The muscle clique
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,152)}咖啡店
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.65,0:02:29.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,螃蟹圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:29.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The crab clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乡村圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The country clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.35,0:02:36.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是喜剧演员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:36.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Comedians?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.13,0:02:36.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:36.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滑稽圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The shtick clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.22,0:02:42.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是生病圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:42.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a sick clique
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:42.48,注释,,0,0,0,,[ sick（生病）与 shtick（滑稽）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.93,0:02:46.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,圈子好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:46.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There sure are a lot of cliques
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过要混哪个圈子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But which clique do we click with?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们正属于那里  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's where we belong, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Nerd Clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.91,0:02:55.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:55.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw, man
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我刚刚加入酷哥圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I just joined the Cool Guys Clique
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.52,0:03:02.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美好时光不长久  兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:02.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it was fun while it lasted, gang
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜没人能酷一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But no one's cool forever
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.85,0:03:05.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw, man
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.69,0:03:07.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能酷一辈子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:07.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not cool forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太酷了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is so cool
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.64,0:03:10.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:10.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星想加入你们的圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I would like to join your clique
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们满员了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're full-up
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.19,0:03:21.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:21.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅三号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerd number three
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别让我妈丢掉我的漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't let my mom throw out my comic books
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们多了个空缺名额
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It appears we do have an opening
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但只能给一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But for only one
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,幸运的新成员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,lucky new member
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,翻硬币决定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flip for it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个名额应该给你  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You should take the spot, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  应该给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right, I should
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.52,0:03:49.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你名额放弃得也太快了  老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:49.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gave up the spot rather quickly, old friend
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's your game?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道什么内幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You take the spot
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  我坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I insist
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you take it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you take it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.01,0:03:58.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:03:58.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you take it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  我坚持把名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I insist you take it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you take it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.15,0:04:01.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:01.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You take it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.45,0:04:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.87,0:04:03.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名额给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:03.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You take it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多得了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right already
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唯一公平的办法就是让你们两个对决
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only fair thing is that you both compete
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.98,0:04:10.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,争取名额
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:10.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the spot
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.83,0:04:16.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村阿宅大对决现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:16.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let the Great Bikini Bottom Nerd-Off begin
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.77,0:04:21.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第一场比赛  角色扮演对决
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:21.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First event, Cosplay Competition
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请第一位候选人穿好扮装服出场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Will the first candidate step out with your costume?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.70,0:04:34.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你到底是在扮演什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:34.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the name of Neptune are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.31,0:04:39.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是臭名昭著的坏蛋  射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:39.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the notorious villain Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.10,0:04:42.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扯淡恶魔还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More like Bland Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, next
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没扮装服不能角色扮演
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't cosplay without a costume
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.67,0:04:56.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:56.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.08,0:05:04.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:04.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bubble
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.27,0:05:06.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是肮脏泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:06.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's the Dirty Bubble
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最棒的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My finest garb
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.01,0:05:12.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,输
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:12.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lose
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.67,0:05:13.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,输
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:13.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lose
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.51,0:05:16.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这轮都输了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:16.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You both lose this round
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.27,0:05:19.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:19.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gross
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(698,218)}强人俱乐部
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强人俱乐部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Salty Spitoon?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.59,0:05:26.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方里面都是无赖和流氓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:26.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a place for roughnecks and rogues
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.16,0:05:27.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶棍和老粗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:27.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lowlifes and louts
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,猪肉和豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pork and beans
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.18,0:05:30.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:30.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是今晚的特餐  猪肉和豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tonight's special, pork and beans
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1566,202)}今晚特餐
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.39,0:05:38.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们过来是因为今天是问答之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:38.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here because it's trivia night
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们次次都能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we always win
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.75,0:05:41.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:41.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Behold
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,人人争夺的黄金强人痰盂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The coveted Golden Spitoon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.56,0:06:02.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到强人俱乐部每周问答比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:02.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Salty Spitoon's Weekly Trivia Contest
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是主持人  强人莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm your host, Sally Spitoon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.37,0:06:10.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天这次比赛  一方是俱乐部自家的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:10.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today's contest is between the Spitoon's own
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强人顾客队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tough Customers
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.95,0:06:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有复出的白痴们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the returning chumps--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.47,0:06:21.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说冠军们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:21.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean champs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.02,0:06:24.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:24.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.02,0:06:32.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各位选手又将再次争夺黄金强人痰盂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:32.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once again, the Golden Spitoon is back up for grabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道答案就按铃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hit the bell if you know the answer
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第一题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First question
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.43,0:06:40.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士的小跟班叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:40.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is the name of Mermaid Man's sidekick?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胆小鸡肝小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chicken Liver Baby Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.73,0:06:46.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:46.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerds?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.45,0:06:49.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给大家展示真正的操作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:49.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me show you how it's done
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名叫企鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First name, Barnacle
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姓男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Last name, Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.57,0:06:57.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:57.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.65,0:07:00.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:00.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next question
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.68,0:07:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁是裤头村最强的海底生物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's the toughest sea creature in Bikini Bottom?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.41,0:07:09.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名叫老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:09.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First name, Mister
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.10,0:07:11.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姓蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:11.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Last name, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:15.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:15.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,强人顾客队
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tough Customers?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.12,0:07:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然是你了  强人莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, you, of course, Sally Spitoon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.31,0:07:26.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正确
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:26.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,答了太多题后
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.97,0:07:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们目前99比99平
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're currently tied at 99 each
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.27,0:07:38.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一题定胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:38.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This next question will be the tiebreaker
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.86,0:07:42.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家对强人俱乐部的客户都有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:42.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are the clientele of the Salty Spitoon called
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,私底下的外号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,behind their backs?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,私底下的外号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Behind our backs?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁敢这么叫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who would ever?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快乐小流氓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Happy Hoodlums
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,答
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.19,0:07:55.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:55.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅队  你们知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerds, do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的胜算来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's our chance to win
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁知道答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's got the answer?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不可能是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be right
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你呢  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about you, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.17,0:08:15.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:15.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.69,0:08:18.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,儿童乐园禁入者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:18.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Weenie Hut Junior Rejects?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.68,0:08:20.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:20.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正确答案是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.96,0:08:24.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:24.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.51,0:08:35.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚好疯狂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:35.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was crazy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海霸王到处跑啊跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how Bubble Bass ran around
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.83,0:08:37.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哭得像个小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:37.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cried like a baby
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.73,0:08:40.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接就昏倒了  瘫到黄金强人痰盂里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:40.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then fainted right into the Golden Spitoon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜他受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sadly, his injury
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.45,0:08:45.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞得我们都没兴趣揍他了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:45.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,robbed us all of the pleasure of clobbering him
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,由于
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Due to
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出现了难以预料的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,unforeseen circumstances
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.32,0:08:58.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村阿宅大对决不得不延期数小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Great Bikini Bottom Nerd-Off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,had to be postponed for a few hours
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.12,0:09:00.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但现在我们又回来举办一轮比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:00.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we're back now with a contest
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.81,0:09:04.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从此可以一劳永逸地决定谁能胜出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:04.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that should help pick a winner once and for all
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.23,0:09:08.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哈维和凯文是你们的随从
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:08.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Harvey and Kevin shall be your squires
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.39,0:09:10.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:10.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.56,0:09:14.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天你们要互相对决  我打个比方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:14.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,today you fight, metaphorically
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,战斗到死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the death
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要跟亡灵对决吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We fight the dead?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.03,0:09:24.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:24.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.14,0:09:25.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个对决
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:25.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two fight
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来决定谁赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I decide the winner
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种死挺凑活的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's a death I can live with
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打个笔方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Matta-fork-lift-ly
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先从好笑的辱骂开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Start with funny name calling
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好笑的辱骂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Funny name calling
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好笑的辱骂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Funny name calling
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方裤屋的海绵爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir Square of the House of Pants
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认为汝乃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,methinks thou art a
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.31,0:09:50.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个可爱小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:50.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a cutie patootie
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可爱小宝贝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A cutie patootie?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你是在耍阴招吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you're playing dirty, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.35,0:09:56.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:56.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石之派大星爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir Patrick of the Rock
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汝乃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thou art, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一颗小甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a sweetie pie
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweetie pie
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.19,0:10:07.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:07.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.38,0:10:10.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看招  蛋糕杯子爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:10.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,En garde, Sir Cup of Cake
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打了我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bonkered myself
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.91,0:10:19.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也打了我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:19.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bonkered myself too
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.37,0:10:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们全都搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're doing it all wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  都够了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认为树屋堡之奇克斯爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Methinks Lady Cheeks of Castle Dome
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要给你们两个阿宅一点教训
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,needs to teach you two nerdballs a lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.44,0:10:42.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看我用中世纪古法揍你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:42.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in Medieval butt-whoopin'
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.28,0:10:47.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:47.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩到底哪一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now which of you two
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.91,0:10:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大脑被腌过的绦虫屁股疮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:52.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,pickle-brained sores
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on the hindquarters of a tapeworm
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我该解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,should I finish off?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.55,0:10:57.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打个比方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:57.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Metaphorically
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Winner
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Winner
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赢家出炉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have a winner
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恭喜珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.78,0:11:07.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是阿宅圈子光荣的新成员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:07.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the proud new member of the Nerd Clique
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢你们邀我加入
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我要有礼貌地拒绝  说出一声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I politely decline by saying
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅三号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nerd number three
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.28,0:11:21.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,显然我们阿宅很难吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:21.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Evidently us nerds taste terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome back
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么  奇克斯爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thoust was saying, Lady Cheeks?
