Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.55,0:12:00.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎收看裤头村新闻体育
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:00.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Bikini Bottom News Sports
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980,812)}裤头村新闻体育
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们正位于美丽的石头滩体育场
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here at beautiful Rock Bottom Stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:08.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978,628)}石头滩体育场
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.51,0:12:08.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头滩运动会即将开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just moments away from the commencement
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of the Rock Bottom Games
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是帕奇帕金斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Perch Perkins
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐在我旁边的是石头滩本地的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and sitting beside me is Rock Bottom's own
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:28.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(178,234)}直播
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.38,0:12:16.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,噗噜噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:16.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,Pbblit Pbblit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1406,972)}噗噜噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(406,972)}帕奇帕金斯
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,今天这天气正适合开运动会  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,What a great day for the games, eh
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,噗噜噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,Pbblit Pbblit?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.58,0:12:24.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:24.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You bet I do
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.29,0:12:28.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,入场的是本届运动会的官方火炬手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:28.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On the field now is the games' official torchbearer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:35.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(572,972)}火炬手进入开幕式会场
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.43,0:12:32.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,其实她就是火炬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:32.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,Actually, she is the torch
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,详细来讲其实是一条火鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,A "fire-fish" to be exact
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么狂热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very hot
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.67,0:12:41.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,圣火盆点燃了  比赛正式开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:41.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cauldron has been ignited and the games have begun
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.92,0:12:44.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在场所有运动队将会角逐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:44.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All of our athletic teams will be competing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,人人争夺的镀金鱼钩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the coveted "Gold-Plated Hook"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是去年的冠军们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's last year's winners
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,噗队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Team Pbblt
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.12,0:12:56.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟大家讲讲比赛规则吧  噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:56.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Explain the game rules to us, Pbblit
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.78,0:12:57.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以上规则将会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:57.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And those rules will be
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.96,0:13:01.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,由我们尊敬的暴脾气们严格强制执行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,strictly enforced
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:01.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by our panel of esteemed curmudgeons
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.63,0:13:03.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裁判们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:03.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,judges
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.67,0:13:04.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,海霸王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:04.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,Bubble Bass
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1568,1020)}海霸王\N海霸王评论秀
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.37,0:13:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,上流小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,Lady Upturn
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1594,1020)}上流小姐米尔德丽德\N赞助商上流百货
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1594,1020)}噗噜噗啦\N噗噗噜卟
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.82,0:13:12.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,还有章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:12.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,And Squidward Tentacles
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.93,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1534,962)}章鱼哥\N章鱼哥闲聊主持人\N作曲家\N思想家 艺术家
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.12,0:13:18.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们评判运动员挥洒汗水的表现期间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And while they are judging
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the players' perspiring performances
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,将由这些人为运动员们擦汗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these guys will be wiping them down
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今年的官方毛巾小弟是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This year's official towel boys
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝和派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob and Patrick
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:30.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,932)}来认识毛巾小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:30.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1336,980)}海绵宝宝                           派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在开始第一场赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now for the first event
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赛袜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Sock Race
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.21,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(522,652)}赛袜
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,袜子出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the socks are off
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后会有闻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smell ya later
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.28,0:13:52.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来噗疯狂旋转  已经失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:52.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like Pbblt is spinning wildly out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.76,0:13:56.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜爆炸就等于取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:56.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, exploding is a disqualification
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.74,0:13:58.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝他明年好运
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:58.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better luck next year
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.47,0:13:59.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:13:59.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your leg
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喜欢撞袜子是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ya like bumping socks, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你撞个德克萨斯体量的力道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give ya a Texas-sized bump
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪撞得弗雷德猛亲墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy is making Fred kiss the wall
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.95,0:14:09.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:09.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My lips
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.48,0:14:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的及膝袜第一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My knee-high is number one
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.37,0:14:22.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别高兴太早  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:22.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.97,0:14:24.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为赛袜的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:24.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because the winner of the Sock Race
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.92,0:14:28.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向来都是最后滑过终点的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:28.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is always the one who slides in last
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,萨姆慢蛞蝓是冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sam Sluggington is the winner
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这堆石头滩的破规则太扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn these crazy Rock Bottom rules
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.77,0:14:43.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一项  投掷体操运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:43.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next event, The Gymnast Hurl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:43.31,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(702,700)}投掷体操运动员
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pbblit
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,体操运动员们正在热身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The gymnasts are warming up
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.94,标准-Chi,,1000,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.94,标准-Eng,,1000,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.16,0:14:54.53,标准-Chi,,1000,0,0,,43B号位往哪走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.62,标准-Eng,,1000,0,0,,Do you know where I can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.53,标准-Eng,,1000,0,0,,find seat 43 B?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.05,0:14:56.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们正在就位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:56.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're getting on their marks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.08,0:15:00.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,投掷手们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:00.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And here come the Hurlers
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.96,0:15:02.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:02.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.04,0:15:03.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:03.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, young man
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.85,0:15:20.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,投手们的得分好低啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:20.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's some low scores for the Hurlers
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都输了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone's a loser
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.07,0:15:32.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级超级超级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:32.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Really, Really, Really
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳近
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Short Jump
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头滩先上场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rock Bottom is up first
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.35,0:15:49.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我同意  裁判们可不会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:49.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I agree, the judges are not gonna like that
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.21,0:15:52.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真为石头滩可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:52.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too bad for Rock Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在到小蜗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it's Gary's turn
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有得分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No score
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗取消了自己的资格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary has disqualified himself
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,经过这一轮轮排除法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By process of elimination
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说不定痞老板还真能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton may actually win this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.69,0:16:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy mackerel
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.42,0:16:24.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板是冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:24.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton is the winner
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1140,568)}最佳作弊奖
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但不幸的是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的裁判可不好骗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you can't fool our judges
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.99,0:16:40.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板赢得了最佳作弊奖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:40.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and Plankton wins for "Best Cheating"
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shame on him
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.75,0:16:43.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过还是恭喜获奖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:43.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And congratulations
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最佳作弊奖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Best Cheating," huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒要给他们见识谁最会作弊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll show them the best cheater
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.45,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1230,304)}跳近
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.27,0:16:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无厘头冲刺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Wacky Dash
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,664)}无厘头冲刺
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.65,0:17:03.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这场比的不是谁跑得最快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:03.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In this race, it's not about who runs the fastest
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.74,0:17:06.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而是谁跑得最无厘头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:06.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's about who runs the wackiest
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.27,0:17:08.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跑最疯的就能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:08.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The craziest legs win
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.13,0:17:11.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多加点芥末酱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:11.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Extra mustard, please
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's hot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我大概率撑得住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I can handle it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.56,0:17:23.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:23.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.82,0:17:26.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:26.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too hot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.09,0:17:28.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:28.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You told him
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too hot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward wins
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但前提是他没被取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or he would if he wasn't disqualified
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.62,0:17:37.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为他也是裁判
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:37.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for also being a judge
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是白费功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Such a waste
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.59,0:17:44.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:44.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get off me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302,634)}底栖觅食
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一项  底栖觅食
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next event, Bottom Feeding
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.67,0:17:49.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:49.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In this contest
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.96,0:17:54.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪位底栖生物吸收最多海藻就能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:54.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,whichever Bottom Feeder sucks up the most algae wins
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.73,0:17:58.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板也列在参赛名单里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:58.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton is listed as a competitor
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我并没看到他在赛道上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I don't see him on the track
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.53,0:18:06.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些裁判在这可判不到我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:06.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those judges can't judge me down here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.70,0:18:08.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定会赢得那个镀金鱼钩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:08.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm winning that gold-plated hook
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我这张嘴全场最大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because I've got the biggest mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对  噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right, Pbblit
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is weird
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.72,0:18:24.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底栖生物们都去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:24.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did all the bottom feeders go?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.95,0:18:29.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把那群白痴都吸走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:29.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sucked up the suckers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.36,0:18:30.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:30.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I win
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.80,0:18:33.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看评分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:33.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see those numbers now
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.14,0:18:34.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:34.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.31,0:18:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,think
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.21,0:18:38.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:38.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so"?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.73,0:18:42.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为痞老板  你犯规了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.73,0:18:42.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because, Plankton, you broke the rules
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.89,0:18:46.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此你赢得了一趟单程潜水优步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:46.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and all that wins you is a one-way "scuber"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你滚出体育场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of the stadium
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把你们全消灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will destroy you all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:55.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,742)}吹气球
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.10,0:18:54.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来是经典回归
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:54.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next, a returning classic
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吹气球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ballooning
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1666,562)}吹气球
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这场很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This one's pretty straightforward
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.15,0:19:00.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两人一队  一名队员给另一名吹气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:00.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In teams of two, one teammate inflates the other
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吹的气要尽可能多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with as much air as they can
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.66,0:19:05.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最大的气球就是冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:05.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The biggest balloon wins
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.87,0:19:10.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打气筒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:10.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pump?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才用不着什么臭打气筒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need no stinking pump
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.25,0:19:19.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1010,976)}诺斯费拉图                  特兰西瓦尼亚海滩独立共和国
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,235,,毫无疑问  泡芙老师是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,180,,No doubt about it, Mrs. Puff is the--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.21,0:19:27.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诺斯费拉图咬了泡芙老师  反败为胜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:27.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nosferatu puts the bite on Mrs. Puff for the win
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.98,0:19:33.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我的气  你这个尖牙小人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:33.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's my air, you fang-toothed phoney
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.86,0:19:39.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师把诺斯费拉图踢进了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:39.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff kicks Nosferatu right in the
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.36,0:19:41.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,沙滩排球赛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:41.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beach Volleyball Game
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.50,0:19:49.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,观众们欣喜若狂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:49.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the crowd is going wild
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我一起的解说员也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And so is my co-announcer
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.73,0:19:56.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冷静一点  噗噜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:56.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Pbblit
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  毛巾小弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, towel boys
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.37,0:20:04.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:04.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They are good
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裁判们可真的不会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The judges really aren't gonna like that
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.12,0:20:30.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:30.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.98,0:20:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要踩油门了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna floor it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.72,0:20:35.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,踩刹车  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:35.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The brake, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.35,0:20:36.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:36.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The brake
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.78,0:20:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师获得冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Mrs. Puff is the winner
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们两位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不客气  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anytime, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.65,0:20:46.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:46.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boys?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.87,0:20:47.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:47.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:51.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(374,624)}最终大奖
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在颁发最终大奖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now, the final award
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚我们看到了这么多冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've seen many winners tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.79,0:20:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但只有一个队伍足够特别  可以获颁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but only one team is special enough to get awarded
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.20,0:21:01.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,镀金鱼钩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:01.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Gold-Plated Hook
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同意得不能再同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have said it better myself
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冠军就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the winner is
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it either
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是毛巾小弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The towel boys?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.78,0:21:19.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝和派大星赢得了金奖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:19.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob and Patrick have won the gold
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为他们擦汗表现出色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for their "toweling"?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.58,0:21:30.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:30.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fools
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.97,0:21:34.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道短路点火潜水优步有多简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:34.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize how easy it is to hot-wire a scuber
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们送的鱼钩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the hook
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.87,0:21:41.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把它弯成一个邪恶手镯送给凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:41.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bend it into an evil bracelet for Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.67,0:21:45.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:45.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我寻思抓到了个腌椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I caught a pickle, says I
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.45,0:22:06.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来  小腌椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:06.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back, little pickle
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我寻思自己好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I be hungry, says I
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起我作弊了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I cheated
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听到了吗  海神王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Neptune?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.32,0:22:14.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:14.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.87,0:22:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里是石头滩体育场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,From Rock Bottom Stadium
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.11,0:22:21.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是帕奇帕金斯  播送完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:21.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this is Perch Perkins signing off
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.78,0:22:22.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝大家晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:22.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say good night
